.TH mdmc-view 1  "view " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-view \- Print a message as markdown to stdout (no attachment extraction)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc view\fR [\fB\-\-body\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a message as markdown to stdout (no attachment extraction)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-body\-only\fR
Print only a header + body, omitting the frontmatter
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Message\-ID, a raw message file path, or `\-` for stdin
